{"id":"1dc2712cae6cd02a","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-inverse-image-stalks-and-finite-limits.md","title":"Theorem II.9 Stalks and Finite Limits of Inverse Image","display":"Theorem II.9 Stalks and Finite Limits of Inverse Image","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-inverse-image-stalks-and-finite-limits","aliases":["14-thm-inverse-image-stalks-and-finite-limits"],"display":"Theorem II.9 Stalks and Finite Limits of Inverse Image","depends_on":["[[14-df-topological-inverse-image]]","[[14-df-germs-and-stalks]]","[[14-thm-etale-bundle-recovery]]","[[14-thm-stalks-detect-equality-and-isomorphisms]]","[[14-df-limits-colimits]]","[[14-df-topological-open-site]]"],"source_location":"II.9 Proposition 3 printed 103; stalk formula from pullback (2), printed 100; DjVu 56–57","source_evidence":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-inverse-image-stalks-and-finite-limits"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-inverse-image-stalks-and-finite-limits</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem II.9 Stalks and Finite Limits of Inverse Image"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"db4fc8431db22e7a\" href=\"?note=db4fc8431db22e7a\" title=\"14-df-topological-inverse-image\">14-df-topological-inverse-image</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"46dda10bcd4e0ee1\" href=\"?note=46dda10bcd4e0ee1\" title=\"14-df-germs-and-stalks\">14-df-germs-and-stalks</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"136d21829e234687\" href=\"?note=136d21829e234687\" title=\"14-thm-etale-bundle-recovery\">14-thm-etale-bundle-recovery</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1ec9054a89b9ba1b\" href=\"?note=1ec9054a89b9ba1b\" title=\"14-thm-stalks-detect-equality-and-isomorphisms\">14-thm-stalks-detect-equality-and-isomorphisms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"55bd5d1a324171ab\" href=\"?note=55bd5d1a324171ab\" title=\"14-df-limits-colimits\">14-df-limits-colimits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3a8105e59309bc16\" href=\"?note=3a8105e59309bc16\" title=\"14-df-topological-open-site\">14-df-topological-open-site</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"II.9 Proposition 3 printed 103; stalk formula from pullback (2), printed 100; DjVu 56–57"},{"key":"source_evidence","html":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>；空间载体、截面值与指标集均取于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>，有关范畴和函子集合在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 中处理。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:(X,\\tau)\\to(Y,\\nu)\">\\(f:(X,\\tau)\\to(Y,\\nu)\\)</span> 连续，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(Y,\\nu)\">\\((Y,\\nu)\\)</span> 上的层。茎公式的参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>；有限极限断言不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 非空。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 为有限小范畴，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D:I\\to\\mathbf{Sh}(Y,\\nu)\">\\(D:I\\to\\mathbf{Sh}(Y,\\nu)\\)</span> 为函子。选定极限锥 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(L,\\pi)\">\\((L,\\pi)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M,\\mu)\">\\((M,\\mu)\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsLimit}_{\\mathbf{Sh}(Y,\\nu)}(L,\\pi,D)\">\\(\\mathrm{IsLimit}_{\\mathbf{Sh}(Y,\\nu)}(L,\\pi,D)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsLimit}_{\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau)}(M,\\mu,f^*\\circ D)\">\\(\\mathrm{IsLimit}_{\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau)}(M,\\mu,f^*\\circ D)\\)</span>；存在性使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3a8105e59309bc16\" href=\"?note=3a8105e59309bc16\" title=\"14-df-topological-open-site\">14-df-topological-open-site</a> 及 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"55bd5d1a324171ab\" href=\"?note=55bd5d1a324171ab\" title=\"14-df-limits-colimits\">14-df-limits-colimits</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 在下式由全部锥分量方程唯一确定。茎使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"46dda10bcd4e0ee1\" href=\"?note=46dda10bcd4e0ee1\" title=\"14-df-germs-and-stalks\">14-df-germs-and-stalks</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_2\">\\(\\pi_2\\)</span> 为集合论有序对的第二投影，下式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t(x)\">\\(t(x)\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_{f,G}\">\\(E_{f,G}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda_{G,x}:(f^*G)_x\\xrightarrow{\\sim}G_{f(x)},\\qquad\\lambda_{G,x}([(U,t)]_{\\sim_x})=\\pi_2(\\pi_2(t(x)))\\quad(x\\in X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda_{G,x}:(f^*G)_x\\xrightarrow{\\sim}G_{f(x)},\\qquad\\lambda_{G,x}([(U,t)]_{\\sim_x})=\\pi_2(\\pi_2(t(x)))\\quad(x\\in X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists!h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau)}(f^*L,M)\\quad\\forall i\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(I)\\ \\mu_i\\circ h=f^*(\\pi_i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists!h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau)}(f^*L,M)\\quad\\forall i\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(I)\\ \\mu_i\\circ h=f^*(\\pi_i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\coloneqq\\iota h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau)}(f^*L,M)\\quad\\forall i\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(I)\\ \\mu_i\\circ h=f^*(\\pi_i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\kappa\\coloneqq\\iota h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau)}(f^*L,M)\\quad\\forall i\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(I)\\ \\mu_i\\circ h=f^*(\\pi_i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsIso}_{\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau)}(\\kappa).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsIso}_{\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau)}(\\kappa).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>茎截面的值即拉回 bundle 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 的纤维；étale 评价同胚把该纤维与茎等同，而拉回纤维恰是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_{f(x)}\">\\(G_{f(x)}\\)</span>，证明首式。有限极限可以用终对象、二元纤维积和等化子构造；étale bundle 的终对象为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\to X\">\\(X\\to X\\)</span>，纤维积仍 étale，两个 bundle 态射的等化子是开子空间（两局部截面相等的集合开放）。这些构造都是普通 slice 空间的相应极限，拉回保持它们，所以得第二式。这里没有声称逆像保持任意无限极限。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-topological-inverse-image","status":"resolved","id":"db4fc8431db22e7a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-topological-inverse-image]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-germs-and-stalks","status":"resolved","id":"46dda10bcd4e0ee1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-germs-and-stalks]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-etal